{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25965","headline":"经隐叟 · 鲍溶","name":"经隐叟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行蹋门外泉，坐披牀上云。\n谁将许由事，万古留与君。\n虚洞闭金鏁，蠹简藏鸟文。\n萝景深的的，蕙风闲薰薰。\n余有世上心，此来未及羣。\n殷勤讳姓名，莫遣樵客闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25965.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25965","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}